      "content": "Pressmore Farmhouse 1. 967 SP 90 SE 5/106 II                       GV 2. Early C18 south block of red brick with old tiled roof.  2 storeys, 3 lattice casements Slightly recessed west wing, similar with 1 lattice casement window.  Corbelled brick cornices.  North block, of similar style and size, added 1905, with panelled roof ridge. Pressmore Farmhouse, barn and granary form a group. Listing NGR: SP9695004063"
